{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sliding Hero is a <strong>brainteasing, explorative puzzle game</strong> where you can only <strong>slide in a single direction</strong> until hitting an obstacle. <br> <br>Will you outsmart the villa\u2019s many trials and unmask the truth behind your imprisonment?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/a6f870afb22e6fd4a1ec5af8c39316b3.poster.avif?t=1769643344\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/a6f870afb22e6fd4a1ec5af8c39316b3.webm?t=1769643344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/a6f870afb22e6fd4a1ec5af8c39316b3.mp4?t=1769643344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A PUZZLE METROIDVANIA OF MOVEMENT AND MYSTERY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imprisoned in a sinister Venetian villa, <strong>use your wits to help Luca Sicomoro</strong>, a Serenissima military man, escape. <strong>Every move is a test of strategy</strong>, turning movement into a puzzle. Navigate a dark and intricate world inspired by <strong>1700s Venice and Carnival\u2019s masked mystique,</strong> <strong>where danger and deception lurk in every shadow</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/b7ba8f476298000e6844a3061f7bf16f.poster.avif?t=1769643344\" width=800 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/b7ba8f476298000e6844a3061f7bf16f.webm?t=1769643344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/b7ba8f476298000e6844a3061f7bf16f.mp4?t=1769643344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER THE SLIDE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use environmental hazards, weapons, artefacts, and your momentum to <strong>dispatch enemies and avoid deadly traps</strong>. Each encounter is a skill test, where <strong>puzzle-solving and combat seamlessly intertwine</strong> in an easy-to-learn, hard-to-master movement system.  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/7041b400ce78b2ec0a4bdee779f5abd3.poster.avif?t=1769643344\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/7041b400ce78b2ec0a4bdee779f5abd3.webm?t=1769643344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/7041b400ce78b2ec0a4bdee779f5abd3.mp4?t=1769643344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/a498b85216f509da6cc4d2cd2e79c0e4.poster.avif?t=1769643344\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/a498b85216f509da6cc4d2cd2e79c0e4.webm?t=1769643344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/a498b85216f509da6cc4d2cd2e79c0e4.mp4?t=1769643344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE AN INTERCONNECTED WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The villa is a <strong>maze of hidden passageways, locked doors, and secrets</strong> waiting to be uncovered. <strong>Unlock new tools</strong> that let you <strong>backtrack</strong> to previously unreachable areas, <strong>forge shortcuts</strong>, and interact with the <strong>eccentric and enigmatic characters</strong> who dwell within.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/d8db961764a2390b566b5f5675272e78.poster.avif?t=1769643344\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/d8db961764a2390b566b5f5675272e78.webm?t=1769643344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/d8db961764a2390b566b5f5675272e78.mp4?t=1769643344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A DARK VENETIAN DREAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a beautifully hand-drawn pixel art world steeped in <strong>the elegance and unease of the Carnival of Venice</strong>. A haunting, original soundtrack inspired by <strong>Italian Baroque melodies</strong> enhances the atmosphere as you piece together <strong>a story of mystery, fate, and self-discovery</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/2ee78a6329d1fc356768c9f7b0da9d2d.poster.avif?t=1769643344\" width=800 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/2ee78a6329d1fc356768c9f7b0da9d2d.webm?t=1769643344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/2ee78a6329d1fc356768c9f7b0da9d2d.mp4?t=1769643344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique puzzle-combat system</strong> built around momentum-based movement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple weapons to unlock</strong>, each with a specific puzzle mechanic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An atmospheric Venetian setting</strong>, blending historical beauty with eerie fantasy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nonlinear Metroidvania exploration</strong>\u2014discover new abilities to open fresh paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging and devious boss fights</strong>, where strategy is key.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fast-paced movement system</strong> designed with speedrunning in mind.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bestiary Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2966300/65c51939c653f2f756d442daf977d0f92bee0b94.jpg"},{"name":"Charlatan Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2966300/56a9ed3d043a2e3e8f9651468a73f0e659e1d92a.jpg"},{"name":"Story Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2966300/c3180ed4d702524b089ee5aa0f82eebf674dcf2e.jpg"},{"name":"Stabbing Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2966300/a6751e62d596d607fb0a83c920c3125222882b04.jpg"},{"name":"Brutal Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2966300/140bec6bafa28a084764d4ca20c46b1309102f53.jpg"},{"name":"Fashion Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2966300/0e78915d132b9e3926111141f88ac48945640dfd.jpg"},{"name":"Shooting Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2966300/b6e879d0390ae30b73f976ed908847b73c5ac6bf.jpg"},{"name":"Piercing Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2966300/bf385d4d1e730a06d7ecd63d0b2d6134a346679a.jpg"},{"name":"Smashing Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2966300/1f75ec99dc8fe50df25e8094aac859e84ef07c49.jpg"},{"name":"Jumping Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2966300/f26dccf9f286381bfb605dc9cf44315b2a16d2ce.jpg"}],"total":24},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2966300?t=1769643344","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/b0a89f47b7d684d272d177e40a668d993663cc0f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769643344","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/950674b8d7f06e2aa7d158f0d689eaef79bcb026/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769643344","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/950674b8d7f06e2aa7d158f0d689eaef79bcb026/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769643344","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3003410,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sliding Hero is a <strong>brainteasing, explorative puzzle game</strong> where you can only <strong>slide in a single direction</strong> until hitting an obstacle. <br> <br>Will you outsmart the villa\u2019s many trials and unmask the truth behind your imprisonment?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/a6f870afb22e6fd4a1ec5af8c39316b3.poster.avif?t=1769643344\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/a6f870afb22e6fd4a1ec5af8c39316b3.webm?t=1769643344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/a6f870afb22e6fd4a1ec5af8c39316b3.mp4?t=1769643344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A PUZZLE METROIDVANIA OF MOVEMENT AND MYSTERY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imprisoned in a sinister Venetian villa, <strong>use your wits to help Luca Sicomoro</strong>, a Serenissima military man, escape. <strong>Every move is a test of strategy</strong>, turning movement into a puzzle. Navigate a dark and intricate world inspired by <strong>1700s Venice and Carnival\u2019s masked mystique,</strong> <strong>where danger and deception lurk in every shadow</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/b7ba8f476298000e6844a3061f7bf16f.poster.avif?t=1769643344\" width=800 height=492 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/b7ba8f476298000e6844a3061f7bf16f.webm?t=1769643344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/b7ba8f476298000e6844a3061f7bf16f.mp4?t=1769643344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER THE SLIDE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use environmental hazards, weapons, artefacts, and your momentum to <strong>dispatch enemies and avoid deadly traps</strong>. Each encounter is a skill test, where <strong>puzzle-solving and combat seamlessly intertwine</strong> in an easy-to-learn, hard-to-master movement system.  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/7041b400ce78b2ec0a4bdee779f5abd3.poster.avif?t=1769643344\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/7041b400ce78b2ec0a4bdee779f5abd3.webm?t=1769643344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/7041b400ce78b2ec0a4bdee779f5abd3.mp4?t=1769643344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/a498b85216f509da6cc4d2cd2e79c0e4.poster.avif?t=1769643344\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/a498b85216f509da6cc4d2cd2e79c0e4.webm?t=1769643344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/a498b85216f509da6cc4d2cd2e79c0e4.mp4?t=1769643344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE AN INTERCONNECTED WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The villa is a <strong>maze of hidden passageways, locked doors, and secrets</strong> waiting to be uncovered. <strong>Unlock new tools</strong> that let you <strong>backtrack</strong> to previously unreachable areas, <strong>forge shortcuts</strong>, and interact with the <strong>eccentric and enigmatic characters</strong> who dwell within.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966300/extras/d8db961764a2390b566b5f5675272e78.poster.avif?t=176964334